        "accession_number": "0001437749-26-008446",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-16",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Many of our competitors are larger and have substantially greater resources than we do, including higher total assets and capitalization, greater access to capital markets, and a broader offering of financial services.",
